  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The stars step down from the heavens to fight at your command.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Amateur Astrologist, essence pool of 3 or higher, Knowledge (arcana) 8 ranks, cannot have the constellations class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the ability to manifest the champion option of the constellation you chose with the Amateur Astrologist feat. If you have taken the Amateur Astrologist feat more than once, choose one of your constellations to gain the champion from.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat multiple times, choosing a different constellation each time. If you gain the constellations class feature after taking this feat, you must immediately retrain this feat, exchanging it for any other feat you qualify for.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
